\s39 \li2520 \fi-604 \f1 \b0 \fs28 + (Class)\b cellClass\b0  \
\fs14\
\fs28 \pard \s3 \li1512 \fi0 \ri1007 \ql \tx3603 \tx3981 \tx4359 Returns the class of cells used by the receiving class (which must be NSButtonCell or one of its subclasses). Returns \b nil\b0  if no cell class has been specified for the receiving class or any of its superclasses (up to NSButtonCell).\
\fs14\
